ns the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and 23% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","Stock-based comp at 47% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 5236% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 6.3% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 424% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Large open-market insider purchases (net $77.1M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"53,425 Shares in BitMine Immersion Technologies, Inc. $BMNR Acquired by Landscape Capital Management L.L.C.","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/53425-shares-in-bitmine-immersion-technologies-inc-bmnr-acquired-by-landscape-capital-management-l-l-c.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795175210.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.919,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["m_and_a"]},{"title":"Bitmine Immersion Technologies (BMNR) annuncia che le proprie partecipazioni in ETH hanno raggiunto 6,08 milioni di token, mentre il valore complessivo delle criptovalute, della liquidit e dei titoli negoziabili ammonta a 11,8 miliardi di dollari","source":"prnewswire.com","link":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/bitmine-immersion-technologies-bmnr-annuncia-che-le-proprie-partecipazioni-in-eth-hanno-raggiunto-6-08-milioni-di-token-mentre-il-valore-complessivo-delle-criptovalute-della-liquidita-e-dei-titoli-negoziabili-ammonta-a-11-8-mi-302943646.html","date":"2026-11-18","timestamp":1794995220.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.34,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Head-To-Head Comparison: Greystone Housing Impact Investors (NYSE:GHI) & BitMine Immersion Technologies (NYSE:BMNR)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/17/head-to-head-comparison-greystone-housing-impact-investors-nyseghi-bitmine-immersion-technologies-nysebmnr.html","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794936088.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.909,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Why Is Bitmine Immersion Stock Falling on Friday?","source":"benzinga.com","link":"https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/11/63494573/why-is-bitm